  "body": "currently, we write code as below if we need json response \r\n```js\r\nfetch(myRequest)\r\n.then(function(response) {\r\n  return response.json();\r\n})\r\n.then(function(res) {\r\n // ...\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\nwht not add an option of dataType optionally like jQuery\r\n```js\r\nfetch(myRequest, {\r\n  dataType: 'json'\r\n})\r\n.then(function(res) {\r\n // ...\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n@annevk  hope your reply",
